[{"title":"登太白楼似陈遂所年兄邓心虞刘见泉何翼轩李敬菊同舟诸丈","author":"郑学醇","text":"百尺城高济水阴，他乡乘暇此开襟。\n酒人问月空楼阁，词客凭阑自古今。\n碣石北瞻双阙迥，昆崙西指浊河深。\n青云器业看公等，何限凭陵八极心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送常明府视篆灌阳常以弥勒守谪判郁林曾与永平之役蒙赏 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"醉离不爱鹔鹴裘，海内逢君意气投。\n家在巴西劳梦寐，人从江左见风流。\n看花此日潘怀县，骑竹何年郭细侯。\n明到漓江相忆否，女华凉月对清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送常明府视篆灌阳常以弥勒守谪判郁林曾与永平之役蒙赏 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"莫向清时叹滞淫，专城今日主恩深。\n弦多蜀国新传曲，箧有平蛮旧赐金。\n入洛久知吴士赋，吊湘犹识楚臣心。\n扁舟不载西瓯石，留伴棠花二月阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送龚别驾","author":"郑学醇","text":"曙催行色满江干，青苧亭边且尽欢。\n我自未图鹏翼转，君今谁不凤毛看。\n梧山晓度千峰雨，章水遥凭一棹寒。\n佩有吕虔刀可赠，未须重叹路行难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿陆斡亭","author":"郑学醇","text":"不断涛声涌玉淙，梦回双阙护千松。\n巢寒鹊傍南枝冷，地迥山从北戒宗。\n铜柱渐通瓯骆部，银河翻注镆铘峰。\n步檐细忆鸳鸾侣，此际鸣珂待禁钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14856,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"郑学醇","text":"玉关何日息狼烽，离思逢春祇万重。\n归梦不知玄菟郡，移营犹见贺兰峰。\n将军别有和戎策，句马宁论给饷供。\n君莫少年誇节侠，几人天幸得侯封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14857,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋别得早梅","author":"郑学醇","text":"相送临溪水，先春独见梅。\n非关风气早，似得为君开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王君弼山房","author":"郑学醇","text":"夜久喧渐息，叶落孤萤飞。\n寒山吐残月，不寝吝清辉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪上晚归","author":"郑学醇","text":"江风吹夜寒，白露凝芳芷。\n遥遥隔浦声，月中人度水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣江","author":"郑学醇","text":"八月江气清，凉风吹不歇。\n扁舟忆远人，长歌对秋月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白范江","author":"郑学醇","text":"舟楫翠烟中，鸡犬丛篁里。\n洞口有渔人，飞花莫随水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭四首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"江汉西悬二别孤，更西还汇两名湖。\n湖边独上孤亭望，吴楚风烟半有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭四首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"苍茫烟水一凭阑，白苧絺衣五月寒。\n风熨翠纹如可御，霞蒸丹片若为餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭四首 其三","author":"郑学醇","text":"水自空濛月自圆，冯陵万顷泛湖船。\n中流莫更吹龙笛，湖上骊龙不得眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭四首 其四","author":"郑学醇","text":"何论海外有仙山，一望沧溟尽大寰。\n可得便乘黄鹄去，白云深叩九螭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京杂咏二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"燕中美酒不当钱，当垆胡姬多少年。\n春光不尽贵游乐，信马高楼杨柳边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京杂咏二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"玉楼春酒破轻寒，锦帐红妆逗夜欢。\n一曲清歌声咽处，彩云片片堕阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访天坛赵鍊师二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"寻真一到上清家，壶里仙源洞里霞。\n风飏翠帘春似海，玉笙吹起碧桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访天坛赵鍊师二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"翛然海鹤共精神，曾是先朝泰畤臣。\n今夜露寒坛上月，佩环犹自礼群真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵寓目","author":"郑学醇","text":"岷峨西涌大江流，江北江南无限秋。\n宫阙万重佳丽地，五云长自护神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮上","author":"郑学醇","text":"秋风淮水下如倾，云际征帆片片轻。\n目断平原双倦鸟，夕阳无限故乡情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚辰与郭霞谷黄鸣谷黄寤堂道南康入燕鸣谷上第余就选二丈南归赋此以别","author":"郑学醇","text":"来时共赋匡山雪，去日愁看帝里春。\n君去我留俱落莫，东风吹柳为谁新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下忆同游诸子","author":"郑学醇","text":"去年花满帝城新，今日天涯忆故人。\n莫怪尊前易惆怅，东风别是一年春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏素馨二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"似是胡云夹雪来，香风吹落越王台。\n城边十万高楼户，珠箔玲珑一夜开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏素馨二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"素蘤秾香分外奇，野田秋草共离离。\n谁云南国芳菲少，一种幽香陆贾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"主家台榭拥鸾旗，正是君王辇幸时。\n绿帻传韝谁侍宴，外庭人道卖珠儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"双燕涎涎入禁闱，避风台上晓风微。\n轻盈不解随仙去，解逐花间赤凤飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣和遗事","author":"郑学醇","text":"青楼灼灼一枝春，曾沐天家雨露新。\n檀板拍残湘水月，依稀犹记梦中身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北流江","author":"郑学醇","text":"勾漏山前一色秋，蘋花开处送孤舟。\n人言湘水偏流北，不道漓江亦北流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采桑石在容县相传采桑女所化","author":"郑学醇","text":"不缘南陌怨归人，何事云根托幻身。\n春色似怜鬟鬓改，年年花绕石傍新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿珠江在博白县","author":"郑学醇","text":"绿罗村外岭头双，绿罗村下水如泷。\n一道寒流秋瑟瑟，古来传是绿珠江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和周于复雨中对梨花望所迟客","author":"郑学醇","text":"春深寒雨裛棠梨，坐对秾妆思转迷。\n风动叶声山犬吠，却疑人到石桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"期不至","author":"郑学醇","text":"野棠飘玉郭公啼，烟草廉纤石径迷。\n香冷博山人不到，东风吹柳万条西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜归曲","author":"郑学醇","text":"山亭夜月凉如水，秋河不动金飙起。\n溪路迢迢人独归，烟树胧胧鸟鹊飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟夜闻雁","author":"郑学醇","text":"为客又逢秋，潇潇揽敝裘。\n五更初过雁，万里只孤舟。\n路隔行中断，江寒影独流。\n所嗟云汉翼，飘泊向何洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕中雨夜","author":"郑学醇","text":"敝褐中无绪，凄然寝复兴。\n十年心上事，一夜雨前灯。\n梦与禁钟断，愁于短铗增。\n乡园及万里，归信缈无凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨子江","author":"郑学醇","text":"大江几千里，迟日独扬舲。\n江树云中绿，吴山雨后青。\n浦帆来漠漠，沙鸟去冥冥。\n坐爱丹霞色，遥看满敬亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重泛彭蠡湖回望匡庐诸峰","author":"郑学醇","text":"昔度匡庐去，千崖霜叶稀。\n今来彭蠡上，万顷雪涛飞。\n江山长是旧，物候自应非。\n白鸥浑不管，来往钓鱼矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅","author":"郑学醇","text":"驿路寒轺晚，山坳忽见梅。\n团晴千态出，殢雪几枝开。\n可惜征途过，何因载酒来。\n只愁香惹梦，翠羽又惊催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗山别业为陈侣梅方伯二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"遥忆罗山下，躬耕旧业存。\n香粳连万井，疏竹隐孤村。\n土鼓喧秋社，春花绽野园。\n谁知寰宇内，别自有桃源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗山别业为陈侣梅方伯二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"嗜静耽丘壑，山灵旧有盟。\n趣朝因紫诰，分陕为苍生。\n丛桂千秋色，红泉百道横。\n无劳赋招隐，明主待持衡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉会楼","author":"郑学醇","text":"昔贤栖隐地，亲见胜于闻。\n海阔常疑雨，山高半是云。\n地从熊岛尽，天向鳄洲分。\n化已成邹鲁，诜诜弦诵群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何紫云之海南","author":"郑学醇","text":"谁云琼管远，闻说似青丘。\n奇甸三千里，仙居十二楼。\n波摇南斗近，月迥夜珠浮。\n莫更随槎往，飘飘犯女牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送卢尉","author":"郑学醇","text":"白首抽簪绶，青山信杖藜。\n去同吴市卒，归有鹿门妻。\n薄宦缘三釜，馀生但几畦。\n送君有明月，直到铁桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬午典试留都事竣恭竭孝陵","author":"郑学醇","text":"昌会开黄道，淮圻起赤龙。\n握符绥化外，辑瑞抚寰中。\n王气钟玄极，坤灵启閟宫。\n河山留玉几，霄汉望遗弓。\n论秀从畿甸，涵濡仰圣功。\n菁莪思颂美，绘画若为工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答欧桢伯先生","author":"郑学醇","text":"邂逅从京国，凄违阅岁华。\n每怜身是客，长傍醉为家。\n地僻稀逢雁，官閒合饵砂。\n世途嗟泛梗，清汉望归槎。\n忆种门前柳，慵看县里花。\n乡心何处折，山郭暮鸣葭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧进士给饟辽东便道汉阳省觐","author":"郑学醇","text":"清时才似季方稀，此日都亭四牡騑。\n转饟恩从天上出，趋庭人自日边归。\n玺书已动辽阳色，綵服还增汉水辉。\n闻说边储须石画，到来何以报垂衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪陆太府仲鹤游水月岩同邓州守常州判","author":"郑学醇","text":"百叠青山一水回，使君乘暇访蓬莱。\n双轓斜映丹砂出，千骑遥从碧涧来。\n佳气迥连勾漏洞，霞标时起会灵台。\n悬知不少天台兴，受简空惭作赋才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南济桥亭同黄梁二博士宴集","author":"郑学醇","text":"阑干百尺俯晴虹，汗漫同游夕照中。\n北雁影迷瑶信断，落霞标映酒杯空。\n坐临南极蛮烟尽，山倚昆崙瑞气通。\n翻忆玉河春试马，画帘轻飏柳丝风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日双桥道中","author":"郑学醇","text":"城南十里双桥路，春日桥西一劝农。\n地是晋兴唐属郡，天连交部汉提封。\n秧抽平野匀朝饷，雨过流泉急暮舂。\n风土不殊民乐业，年年租税自输供。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悟山九日","author":"郑学醇","text":"客衣谁不怯寒霜，千里归心系野航。\n黄菊又逢佳节赏，紫萸偏厌异乡囊。\n秋阴近匝秦瓯越，海色遥通汉夜郎。\n极目峭帆东翥尽，醉来烟树只苍苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨憩罗衣寺","author":"郑学醇","text":"山头不断墨云飞，山下行人雨湿衣。\n沾洒似随孤鹫至，空濛应护法龙归。\n香飘野色看无尽，响答疏林听未稀。\n坐觉尘冥今一洗，顿令心亦长禅机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发浔江答费郡丞","author":"郑学醇","text":"木落天空秋水清，扁舟独夜听猿声。\n三江愁色华缁鬓，九月霜花照客程。\n多病渐忘霄汉梦，忆归何限薜萝情。\n罗浮东近三珠树，飞鹤无心向帝城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日邓少熙昆玉携酒浮邱霍勉斋孙运起叔衍源弟侣日同集","author":"郑学醇","text":"紫烟楼傍少城隈，表里河山亦壮哉。\n黄木自萦秦尉垒，白云犹拥汉朝台。\n一从下濑驱船入，无复仙人跨石来。\n日暮莺声千树里，且凭春色送深杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠游匡庐为黎瑶石","author":"郑学醇","text":"匡庐地势盘吴楚，秀出天南第一峰。\n九叠暮云开锦幢，大江秋色浸芙蓉。\n飞流澒洞银河落，石室苍茫紫气封。\n云壑别来今几载，烦君一访旧游踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答阳电陆营家兄用韵","author":"郑学醇","text":"林壑久知盟野鹤，云霄无复着飞凫。\n何如天外腰龙剑，坐啸军中握虎符。\n佳会几时联隶萼，相思何处寄蘼芜。\n夜深鸣轧江城角，千里还同明月孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"繁苞嫩蕊斗年芳，昨夜东风又海棠。\n梅已着枝桃结子，可怜春色似河阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"署中二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"谁将雪朵缀缃枝，香雾濛濛夜色迟。\n无复閒情对芳物，病怀空许月明知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈费郡丞","author":"郑学醇","text":"朱明洞口旧柴扉，万壑千峰翠作围。\n何限并栖珠树鹤，借来一只便东归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南济亭送陈少府归缙云","author":"郑学醇","text":"长亭东望括苍遥，马首秋云片片骄。\n归去山中抱明月，可能相忆在溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗波潭上有石城土酋岑瑛所筑","author":"郑学醇","text":"贪看樽石临潭水，不觉潭花露湿衣。\n何限消沉终古事，碧天无际月轮飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"郑学醇","text":"懒归双娥似旧痕，花开花落自朝昏。\n敢将纨扇题秋怨，不尽君王未报恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行","author":"郑学醇","text":"白马金鞭出狭斜，垆头今日醉谁家。\n香风蹀躞归时路，半是春泥半是花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张昆海明府","author":"郑学醇","text":"石楠花发下漓江，别酒何因醉玉缸。\n我尚薄游君且去，古来雄剑不能双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"坑灰飞作垄头尘，报国还谁解致身。\n世上有书焚不了，一编留与为韩人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"草昧英雄是钓徒，时来南面各称孤。\n可怜只解王侯乐，岂解扁舟泛五湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下酌诸昆弟","author":"郑学醇","text":"春晴日日见花开，岁月无情短鬓催。\n花间几奉连枝会，乐事非关在酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海珠寺","author":"郑学醇","text":"越王台前日未曛，越王城边江水分。\n千年宝刹中流出，尽日閒僧看水云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中丞凯歌四首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"大将桓桓誓水军，炎荒千里净妖氛。\n洗兵海角亭边月，捲甲铜船湖上云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中丞凯歌四首 其二","author":"郑学醇","text":"大廉山外小廉山，叠鼓扬旗第一湾。\n朝拥舳舻横槊出，暮驱酋馘凯歌还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中丞凯歌四首 其三","author":"郑学醇","text":"五月南中正毒淫，轻风一埽翠涛深。\n陈师不用鱼丽阵，横笛空传龙塞音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴中丞凯歌四首 其四","author":"郑学醇","text":"千年汉将有铜标，谁道明珠久寂寥。\n从此月明歌吹入，轻鸥千点送寒潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人归江西二首 其一","author":"郑学醇","text":"豫章城上有高楼，云是滕王此旧游。\n归去凭阑翘首望，青苍一片是罗浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":14924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]